onely  character we find at the beginning of  the series is a bit closer to alec  guinness's obi-wan kedobi than my sort  of  swashbuckley you know general kenobi  that are running around on lizards and  stuff so i loved it very much and i and  i've always got to feel  alec guinness in my  head or sitting on my shoulder wherever  he is i've got to i've got to feel like  him to whatever degree when i'm playing  the role and and it was just felt that  bit closer to him there's more to life  than your farm owen  he needs to see that there's a whole  galaxy out there i'm asking you  to leave us alone ben i mean it  is he okay  you don't care if he's okay  you care if he's showing my  responsibility owen i'm his uncle we  talked about this when the time comes he  must be trained now after we've just  finished doing this television series  with the stagecraft set you know we're  surrounded by this huge dome that is an  lcd screen that they play the  backgrounds onto which is connected to  the camera reads the iris on the camera  it reads the movement of the camera so  as the camera moves the perspective of  the background will move  and  you shoot against it  and you don't have to put it on  afterwards it's there but for us it  means you're surrounded by what feels  like the real thing  raise your head  [Music]  i said raise your head  [Music]  if you're in the desert well there's a  desert set on the floor and everything  but everywhere you look around you  and above you is the desert and it feels  really real but if you're flying through  space and your spaceship  space is scutting past you the stars are  flying by you it feels much more  realistic  it's much more fun  big fish  big fish was my first time in the south  it was my first time in alabama anyway  and i loved it i asked them to rent me a  pickup truck and i drove myself to work  in my pickup truck every day  oh i loved it it was great it was  amazing working with tim burton i've  always hoped that that might 